@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Read tutoring agreement overview
actor Tutor
participant "Agreement overview API" as Api
participant "GetTutoringAgreementOverviewHandler" as Handler
database "SQL Server" as Db

Tutor -> Api: GET /api/tutors/tutoring-agreements/{agreementId}/overview
Api -> Handler: Query with tutor account and agreement ID
Handler -> Db: Read owned agreement, rate and student details
Db --> Handler: Agreement or no match
alt Missing or foreign agreement
  Handler --> Api: TutoringAgreements.NotFound
  Api --> Tutor: 404 Not Found
else Agreement found
  Handler -> Db: Find first scheduled lesson that has yet to end
  Db --> Handler: Next lesson or no match
  Handler -> Db: Count draft and published materials
  Db --> Handler: Material count
  Handler -> Handler: Calculate lesson estimate if rate is set
  Handler --> Api: Agreement overview
  Api --> Tutor: 200 OK
end
@enduml
